gfx.fatal.body:
No graphics adapter on this computer could be used, the built-in software one included.

Reason: {reason}

What to do:
- update the graphics driver from the manufacturer's site and restart the computer;
- on a remote desktop or a virtual machine, turn on 3D acceleration there;
- if it keeps failing, send this log to support: {log}

gfx.lost.body:
The graphics device was lost ({reason}). Your unsaved work is kept in an autosave snapshot, and DDC Editor offers it at the next start.

What to do: start DDC Editor again. If it happens again, update the graphics driver or start with safe graphics.

Log: {log}
